{
  "recommendation": "Based on the promotional offers currently documented, the EcoCard is the strongest sign-up-bonus option.",
  "offer": {
    "bonus": "2,000 sustainability points, worth up to $20 when redeemed as a statement credit or Rho-Bank checking-account credit",
    "requirement": "Spend $5,000 in eligible purchases during the first month after account opening",
    "qualification": "You must be a new customer, and the account must remain open and in good standing when the bonus is awarded",
    "exclusions": "Returns, chargebacks, disputed transactions, balance transfers, cash equivalents, and fees do not count toward the spending requirement"
  },
  "important_terms": {
    "annual_fee": "$50",
    "purchase_apr": "19.99% on carried balances",
    "foreign_transaction_fee": "1.0%",
    "minimum_credit_score": "No credit-score requirement is specified"
  },
  "other_option": "If you prioritize ongoing cash back rather than the sign-up bonus, the Gold Rewards Card earns 2.5% on all purchases, but it requires an active Rho-Bank+ subscription. I did not find a documented sign-up bonus for that card.",
  "caution": "The EcoCard bonus requires substantial spending in a very short period, so it is generally best only if you can meet the requirement with normal planned purchases and pay the balance in full.",
  "next_step": "If you tell me your expected monthly spending, whether you prefer points or cash back, and whether you already have Rho-Bank+, I can help compare the likely total value."
}
